| Bedroom 3 | (10.0, 10.7) → (13.5, 14.0) | 3.5 × 3.3 | 11.55 | As above. |
| Bedroom 4 | (13.5, 10.7) → (16.5, 16.0) | 3.0 × 5.3 | 15.9 | Spans the full rear depth; windows in the rear wall (`y = 16`) and the right wall (`x = 16.5`). |
